Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Having prepped the barn for the harvest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们刚把谷仓整理好准备丰收
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were now hurriedly converting it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在又得赶紧把它改成结核隔离区
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}into a TB-isolation unit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for the cow that hadn't passed the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给那头没通过检测的牛用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你过来吧 恐怕对你来说 不是什么好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm afraid it's not good news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] She's been separated from her calf down there, she's really distressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它跟它的牛犊被分开了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}²She's pregnant with twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它特别难受 它还怀着双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shouldn't we get the calf in here as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不该把牛犊也弄进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] No, because remember what Dilwyn said?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 因为迪尔翁说了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If the calf comes in, the calf will have to go as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“如果牛犊进来 那也得一起处理掉”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Is that calf gonna be crying tonight? Or will she be crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今晚牛犊会叫 还是它会叫？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Yeah, one of them will be. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 它会叫 总有一个会叫 -是啊
