Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.72,0:01:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这病太可怕了 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] It's just sad that a cow should never be on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}牛就不该被单独关着 太惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] I know. -A cow is a herd animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我知道 -牛是群居动物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.68,0:01:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.68,0:01:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它是头牛
