Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd got so relaxed about it hadn't we? 'Cause we'd been fine for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们以前对这事太放松了 是吧？
