Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这么多年一直没事 -我知道 都做过十次检测了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now... I can't bear it. Such a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道！真受不了 太突然了
