Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.64,0:01:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们去接终局 因为考虑到它的重要性
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because given how important he was,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we felt it best to isolate him from the rest of the herd as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们觉得最好也把它跟牛群隔离开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Farming's shit, innit? -[Jeremy] Yeah.
