Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's breathing like she's got fluid on her lungs I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得它呼吸起来像肺里有积液
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] The best thing is... -[Lisa] So is that pneumonia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 那是肺炎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah, that's the pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:29.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 是肺炎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Yeah, I just hope it's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我只希望还来得及
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I would say that is not a well calf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只能说 这头牛犊状态不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] We've got to keep feeding her for the next couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来几天 我们得一直
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And hopefully she'll get her strength back as the antibiotics kick in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-给它喂奶 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}希望抗生素起效之后 它能恢复体力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, as she gets her strength back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 等它体力恢复了 就会重新开始吃妈妈的奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}she will start feeding off her mum again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Ogh, Christ Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的老天爷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Hoping that would be the last time we needed to build a pen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}希望这是我们最后一次搭围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we tidied away the rest of the fencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把剩下的栅栏料收了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That's all we've done for two days is build cattle pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这两天我们就光搭牛栏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just want to get our harvest in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只想赶紧出去收割
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Whoa. Move out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往外挪一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Oh! -[Kaleb] Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}停！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I'm going to the fucking pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我他妈要去酒吧了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[door opening]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That is the last straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是压垮我的最后一根稻草
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[dramatic music]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  After all the trauma we'd been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经历了这么多糟心事之后 我终于等来了好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I finally got some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[music intensifies]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We could start harvesting before I went off to hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以在我去医院之前开始收割了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we'd begin with the oats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们先从燕麦开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's slightly weird doing it without Simon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有西蒙来做这事儿感觉有点怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:08.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but exciting to be doing it with Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但能跟卡莱布一起干依然让人兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And especially exciting because Kaleb had bought himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尤其让人兴奋的是 卡莱布 给自己买了一台联合收割机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a combine harvester.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[dramatic music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mighty Lamborghini pressed into service once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}强大的兰博基尼再次投入使用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No beeping or the nonsense we got from the green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不像那台绿色的老是滴滴响
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that for one snazzy trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 多时髦的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't realise how big they are until you sit in one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不坐进去、开上路 还真不知道它们有多大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you drive one down a road and you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你一开才发现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}oh yeah, I actually am bigger than the road nearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“操 我比这条路都宽”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[car hooting] -[Kaleb] Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That'll be tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有点紧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[car hooting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Maybe I should have gone the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也许我该走另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  At the oats field, I got my first sight of Kaleb's leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了燕麦地 我第一次 看到卡莱布的那个庞然大物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Holy cow, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 你看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is a whopping combine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好大的联合收割机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much wider is that header than Simon's?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个割台比西蒙的宽多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Eight foot wider. -[Jeremy] Eight foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-宽2.4米 -2.4米？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}His was a 22 and that's a 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的是6.7米 这个是9.1米
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So you should have this done in two hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你应该两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-就能干完 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] And it was only 35 grand? -[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-而且才花了三万五？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause a new combine is what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-新的联合收割机要多少钱？ -大概五十万往上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Like half a million up. -Half a million, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三…五十万 对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I can't believe how cheap that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真不敢相信这么便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  But then when he started it up, all became clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但等它发动起来 一切就都明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:08:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rattling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[banging]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's quite wobbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它挺晃的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah, it has some vibration on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 有点振动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Here we go, Kaleb Cooper is harvesting Diddly Squat Farm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们出发 卡莱布第一次 在迪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收割
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna have to... Up...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得…抬起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它抬起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think I'm gonna have to chuck that out a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我得再小心一点给油门
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}终于
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it actually doing any harvesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它真的在收割吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You're definitely just bending the oats over
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你只是把燕麦压弯了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then they're just coming back up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它们又弹回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I think it's so short I'm really struggling to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我觉得麦秆太短了 很难割到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] It's like combining a lawn. -[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-就像在割草坪 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna have to try to adjust the header lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得试着把割台调低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Yeah, that's better. That's now cutting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 好多了 现在在割了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Is it? -[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-是吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, your first field at Diddly Squat and we've given you a difficult one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你在迪丽斯库阿特的第一块地 我们给了你一个难啃的骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is a hard one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这…这块地真难弄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[banging]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What was that? That's a stone. Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？是石头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你听到了吗？ -听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] 'Cause I'm having to go so low,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我必须放得这么低
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we're gonna have to just risk it this year
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以今年只能冒险 可能会打到石头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and potentially take the odd stone in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because if I go any higher, I'm gonna miss all of the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为再调高 就会漏掉所有麦穗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[banging]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you're harvesting rocks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你现在连石头一起收了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Fortunately, some oats were being harvested as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 我们也收到了一些燕麦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And eventually, it was time to fire up the Lambo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}终于 该发动兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and start grain carting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始运粮了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh, hello, he's doing it. I betta be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}喂 它开始倒了 我最好…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry, I didn't know he was actually gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起 我不知道它真的会那样做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:10:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, for God's sake, Kaleb! You're... What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:10:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看在上帝的份上 卡莱布 你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over radio]  What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't afford spillages like that this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年我们可经不起这样撒漏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[upbeat folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[banging] -[Kaleb] Shitting hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio] This is really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm struggling to cut this. It's so fucking short.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我割得很吃力 这他妈太矮了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[banging]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  It's making a horrible noise, I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在发出可怕的噪音 我不知道是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Could you come and see if you can hear this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能过来听听这噪音吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, it's these.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是这些东西 我知道是怎么回事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Practical, genuinely, it's these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}实际上 真的 就是这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That one's not affected, then you can see where it's rubbing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个没受影响
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Oh, fuck me, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你可以看到在摩擦的地方 这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I think what's happened is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我操 对 -我觉得是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-you know you've been running really low? -[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你一直开得特别低 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I reckon you hit the earth with it and you've broken it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得你用它撞到地面 然后把它撞坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ow! Shitting hell! Fucking hell, that's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈的！那…操 好烫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't. Whatever you do, don't touch that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你刚才碰它了？ -不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because they're gonna melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}千万别碰那个 那玩意儿会…那会融化的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] I need some tools. -[Jeremy] All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要点工具
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I think it's going very smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我觉得进展非常顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got half a trailer load and it's five past twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}才十二点零五分 我们已经收了半拖车了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:25.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy scoffing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[upbeat music]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  It was an hour before Kaleb's budget combine got going again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布那台廉价收割机 折腾了一个小时才重新动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I thought we'd start this field at 8, 8:30, this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来想着今早八点 八点半开始割这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and have it done by 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}十一点就能完事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not like we're fighting moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}反正我们也不需要烦恼湿度问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[raindrops tapping] -[Jeremy] Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tapping continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Maybe we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也许需要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That can't be rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那不可能是雨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[scoffing] It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是雨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit! I cannot believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操 真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at... That's rain, innit? It's gonna rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 下雨了 对吧？要下雨了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  For the first time since fucking February,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的二月以来第一次下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the day we start harvesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在我们开始收割的这天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这他妈什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] It honestly beggars belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 真叫人难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd say that was already...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得那已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I shall look on the CCTV of the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}实际上 我看看酒吧的监控
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it raining at the pub?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧那边在下雨吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which is nine miles in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那边14公里外
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at that. Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 我操！看见了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what's coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雨要下过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.60,0:12:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've had it, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.60,0:12:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们完了 哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need to get what we've got in the trailer into the dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得把拖车里收的这点 送到干燥区
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall we just load up with what you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要不要先把你现在的装满？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我觉得行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck it, we're not gonna pay drying charges this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈的 今年我们可不付晒干费了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That would be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do not want heavy downpour on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}绝对不能被大雨淋到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快快快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Tell me when you're empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}装完了就告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All yours, mate. Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全归你了 哥们 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Here comes the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雨来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I can't even see the other side of the valley now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我现在连山谷对面都看不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really coming down now. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在雨下大了 快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tyres screeching]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's never gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我操
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not now, not now, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别现在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm in such a panic I can't do it any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我太慌了 做不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}终于
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Mercifully, the rain eventually stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢天谢地 雨总算停了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft orchestral music]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And after three hours of warm sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经过三个小时温暖的阳光…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[grain cracking]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}13.6!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}13.6！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Let's go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  We got going again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我们又开工了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft orchestral music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 我们进入了一种完美的 金色黄昏的收割节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were in a perfect golden hour harvesting groove.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got a deer in front of me. Come on, little one, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我前面有只鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快走 小家伙 让开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now I'm back with a smile on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我回来了 脸上带着笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Sun's out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太阳出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}combine's working properly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}联合收割机现在也正常了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio]  Now, we're farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们这才叫务农
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa. Slowly, slowly, slowly, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}慢慢地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh, that's right at the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 在后面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  See you concentrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你集中注意力了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing over the radio]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're spilling some! You're spilling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 你漏了 你漏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're spilling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was too busy calling him a wanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我当时正忙着骂他傻逼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Beautifully done, Jeremy. Beautifully done, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得漂亮 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you watching that, Piastri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}皮亚斯特里 你看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就是说说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was just thinking, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过我刚才在想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}now we're alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在就剩我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that if I hadn't have got myself checked out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我当时没去检查
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and they hadn't caught the problem early,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没能早点发现问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this could well have been my last harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很可能是我经历的最后一次丰收了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's only because they did catch it early there's every hope
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正因为发现得早 所以才有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll be harvesting this farm for many, many years to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还能收割这个农场很多很多年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Mate, I wanna thank you. This is like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}兄弟 我想谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ever since I was a boy, this is a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像一个梦 从我小时候就开始的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Especially when I started here, 10 years ago, believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真的是梦想成真 尤其是我刚开始在这儿干的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and this is my first year being sat in the combine doing the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不管你信不信 我在这儿干了十年
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这是我第一次 坐在联合收割机里干这活儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is... It's an honour, but absolute...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是…一种荣幸 而且…我太兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm buzzing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I'm buzzing 'cause it's my farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 我兴奋是因为这是我的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's buzzing 'cause he's in his own combine for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他兴奋是因为他第一次 开上了自己的联合收割机
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Everybody's buzzing at Diddly tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今晚迪丽斯库阿特所有人都很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  As the sun began to set, there was some welcome news from Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太阳开始落山的时候 卡莱布带来了一个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Well, that's the oats done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}燕麦割完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完事了 而且结束得很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And finished well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy over the radio] I'll see you tomorrow, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明天见 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Yeah, catch you tomorrow. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 明天见 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  No, thank you. Enjoyable day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 谢谢你 愉快的一天…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, a fraught day, but we did get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 是闹心的一天 但我们还是干完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Thanks to the drought,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为干旱 燕麦的产量肉眼可见地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the oats yield was visibly smaller than in previous years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比往年少
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But it could have been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但还不算最糟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could have been the next crop we harvested,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最糟的是我们下一个 要收的作物 芥菜籽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the mustard seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[softly] Jesus wept.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean... Just so that the ladies and gentlemen understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 这…为了让各位明白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We should have, you know, filled this section, you know, with a good...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们本来应该把这块区域填满… -对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many acres is that field?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…全放上优质…那块地多大？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Five? Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五英亩？六英亩？多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, we only... It was 2.4 hectares.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}2.4公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So 5 acres. -[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以是五英亩 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But we only combined half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们只收了一半
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which did you get, the brown or the yellow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你收的是哪一半？棕色还是黄色？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-The far side. -The far side, the brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-远处那块地 没错 -远处那块地 棕色的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-The yellow failed. -Failed, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-黄色的绝收了 -绝收了 对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The next morning, I was told
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 我被告知
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that my cancer operation would happen in six days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的癌症手术将在六天后进行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And I desperately wanted to get both the winter wheat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我拼命想在那之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the spring barley harvested before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（冬小麦）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…把冬小麦和春大麦都收完
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.20,0:17:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（春大麦）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[thundering] -[soft folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, sod's law,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但墨菲定律发力了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it immediately started raining again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天立刻又开始下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, we gotta get timings worked out in all seriousness because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得算好时间 说真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, the pressure's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 压力来了 -今天因为天气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Today's likely to be a write-off 'cause of the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-基本算废了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那我们就剩… -也许明天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Which leaves us with Wednesday... -Potentially tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…周三、周四、周五、周六…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sunday, I have to go down to London
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}周日 我得去伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause I'm in in the hospital at 6:30 on Monday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为周一早上六点半我就要到医院
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I really want to try and get it done by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的想尽量在那之前把活儿干完
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you've got... Your third child is due...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你还有… 你的第三个孩子预产期…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, potentially the end of next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能在下周末
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But she's always like seven days early.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但她通常都会提前七天左右
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ Almighty. So we've...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's all right. I mean, as long as I'm there for the birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没关系 只要我赶上孩子出生就行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Incredibly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是不可思议 在经历了 有记录以来最干旱的夏天之一之后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}after one of the driest summers on record
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and far too late to help the crops,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雨却连续下了三天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it then rained solidly for the next three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对庄稼来说已经太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:18:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（7月30日）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（7月31日）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant it was Saturday
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（8月1日）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before Kaleb could bring his combine back to Diddly Squat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着直到周六…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（周六）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…卡莱布才能把他的联合收割机 开回迪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and this time, to hasten his passage through the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这一次 为了让他能更快地…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（奇平诺顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I provided an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…穿过镇子 我提供了一次护送服务
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All those years he's given me stick
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（超大载荷）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because my tractor is "too big"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这么多年来 他一直拿我的拖拉机 “太大”来挤兑我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then he goes and buys a combine
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后他自己买了一台
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}bigger than a Nimitz-class aircraft carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比尼米兹级航母还大的联合收割机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:34.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy over the radio]  You're clear to come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  I'm way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正在路上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[woman] At least, we're not the only ones that block the roads up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想要面包和啤酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you want bread and lager?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[woman] Yep! -You need a combine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你需要一台联合收割机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[woman] 100 percent! -[Jeremy chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Thanks to my "professional escort services",
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多亏了我专业的护送服务 我们很快就到了农场…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were soon at the farm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.76,0:19:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and gearing up to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.76,0:19:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并准备开工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Weather: holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天气 一如既往
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tractor: working well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拖拉机 运转良好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's get some wheat in this trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往这拖拉机里装点小麦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:09.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  I now had just a day and a half to harvest the wheat and the barley
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在只有一天半的时间 在去医院之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before going off to hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把小麦和大麦收完
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But the hugeness of Kaleb's combine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但卡莱布的联合收割机体积巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}meant it could harvest extremely quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}意味着它可以收得飞快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这拖拉机满得真吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a staggeringly full trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.68,0:20:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Normally, with two combine loads, albeit with a smaller combine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.68,0:20:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}通常 两车联合收割机的量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's sort of three-quarters full.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哪怕是小一点的收割机 也就装个四分之三
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's properly full.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次是实打实装满了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  See you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-一会儿见 -走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have to be really speedy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得动作非常快 因为我觉得你不在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because I don't think I'm gonna make it around again
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我转不了一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}without you being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there can be no shilly-shallying here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这里可不能拖拖拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}no making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不能出错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[crashing] -Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈的 把后视镜给撞回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's knocked the bloody door mirror back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] In.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's get this bloody mirror back out again. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把这破后视镜再掰回去 操
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[pressing button]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我被困在自己的驾驶室里了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm trapped in my own cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Can someone on the film crew come and pull this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能不能… 来个摄制组的帮我拉一下这个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just pull it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它拉回去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, that's not brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不太妙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's it, this is where I live now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这样吧 这就是我现在的家了 我住进驾驶室里了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:34.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I live in the cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio]  Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I'm ready. I'm full. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我准备好了 我满了 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Chris is going to have a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克里斯要试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.52,0:21:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[clanking] -[Jeremy] Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's probably overdone it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 可能用力过猛了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}["Tiger Feet" by Mud]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Come on now, let's not make a mess of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 现在别搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Quick, quick, quick. What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快快快 他在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:21:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] How in the corner is that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全倒在角落里 多完美啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And back we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们回去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪  All night long, you've been looking at me ♪
