Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们连续干了好几个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the going was smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进展很顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ You've got your hips swinging out of bounds ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And I like the way you do... ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio]  Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:27.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy over the radio] Totally professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常专业
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ That's right, that's right, that's right, that's right ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I really love your tiger light ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ That's neat, that's neat, that's neat, that's neat ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.12,0:22:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I really love your tiger feet ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Quarter to three, Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}周六 2点45
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This time tomorrow, I set off for London.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明天的这个时候 我就出发去伦敦了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.24,0:22:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Come the evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了晚上 我们离收完小麦只差
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were only two cartloads away from finishing the wheat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两拖车的量了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which meant that tomorrow morning, with an early start and some luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着明天早上 如果早点开始 再有点运气
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd get the barley done as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们也能把大麦收完
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tractor beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tractor beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] "Clutch pedal short circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“离合器踏板短路”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.40,0:23:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The clutch pedal sensor, engine power..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.40,0:23:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}离合器踏板传感器 发动机功率…出现短路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a short.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Kaleb, we've got a serious problem in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 我们这儿出了严重的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Clutch pedal sensor grounding short circuit."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“离合器踏板传感器接地短路”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.72,0:23:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, you've got no clutch at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.72,0:23:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 你完全没有离合器了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's paralysed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全动不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  In desperation, I called Ben, the local Lambo mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}绝望之下 我打电话给 当地的兰博基尼拖拉机修理工本
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}晚上好 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Ben quickly discovered it wouldn't be a simple fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}本很快发现这不是简单的修理
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Ben] It's definitely the sensor's gone. -[Jeremy] Well, we... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-肯定是传感器坏了 -我们…对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  But when he heard about the urgency,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但当他听说了事情的紧迫性后 他做了干农活的人会做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he did what farming people do:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.08,0:23:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}cancelled his plans for the evening to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.08,0:23:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}取消了他晚上的计划来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:24:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Ben] I'm gonna rob, pillage and raid another tractor in someone's yard
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:24:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…那个传感器 我就是去别人院子里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to get you up and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抢、偷、劫另一台拖拉机的零件 也得让你的车跑起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我感激不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:08.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Ben] We will get you up and running in one way, shape or form.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会以某种方式 某种形式让你的车跑起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.16,0:24:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（8月3日）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Overnight, he dragged the tractor back to the yard
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他一夜之间把拖拉机拖回了院子里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and tried everything to get it going again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尝试一切办法让它重新动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Ben sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Ben] So, I'm having to go through and check every plug,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我得检查
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}every wire, every control unit
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每一个插头、每一条电线 每一个控制单元
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from basically here all the way down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上从这儿开始 一直往下 经过变速箱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.36,0:24:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}via the gearbox back up to everything up in this corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.36,0:24:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再回到这个角上的所有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.52,0:24:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh shit, really? -[Ben] Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.52,0:24:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-操 真的吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.32,0:24:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I know this is an impossible question to answer but I'm gonna ask it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.32,0:24:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我知道这是个没法回答的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When do you think it will be mended?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我还是要问
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.96,0:24:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得什么时候能修好？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.80,0:24:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you got it back today, it would be some form of a miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.80,0:24:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果今天能修好 那就算是个奇迹了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.24,0:24:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause I've gotta take half the cab apart, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.24,0:24:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我得把半个驾驶室拆开 对 所有这些…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.12,0:24:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.12,0:24:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.16,0:24:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  In the end, though, it didn't matter anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.16,0:24:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但最后 其实也都无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That is... Yeah, that's... -[Kaleb] Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是…对 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-雨？ -那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] It's wet rain as well. -[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-还是湿雨 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rain drumming]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.72,0:25:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll go pack my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.72,0:25:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去收拾行李了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-No point hanging around, is there? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-再待着也没意义了 对吧？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.40,0:25:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Not gonna get any harvesting done. -Get over there and get comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.40,0:25:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-收不了庄稼了 -过去那边 安顿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.16,0:25:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.16,0:25:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.08,0:25:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Barley. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.08,0:25:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-大麦 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, er, I'll see you on the flip side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't worry about anything here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别担心这里的一切 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Look after yourself. -Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-保重 -我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa, look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 照顾好他
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.84,0:25:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, she's back. She's gotta grain cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.84,0:25:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 她会回来 她得开运粮车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:44.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I know, but driving him up there. -I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 但你开车送他过去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.28,0:25:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll be back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.28,0:25:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-送你去 -明天回来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.16,0:25:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -[Kaleb] You need anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.16,0:25:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -需要什么就说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.84,0:25:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well no, I'll be in at 6 in the morning, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.84,0:25:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我早上六点就要进去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.56,0:25:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah, we can do Facetime if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.56,0:25:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你想的话我们可以视频通话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll put you on the front of the tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把你挂拖拉机前面
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Okay. -Yeah? All right, look after yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好 -行？保重
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.08,0:26:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] See you. -[Kaleb] See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.08,0:26:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-再见 -回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.08,0:26:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-See y'all. -Thanks, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.08,0:26:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再见 大家再见
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.12,0:26:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}See you everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.60,0:26:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（8月4日 杰里米手术）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.24,0:26:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（5日 丽莎培训）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.88,0:26:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] All right. Off the clutch. -[Lisa] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.88,0:26:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好的 行 松开离合器 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.36,0:26:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Always at a moving speed where it's just creeping at 2 K.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.36,0:26:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-始终保持移动速度… -好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.20,0:26:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…就两公里的时速慢慢挪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Little turns like this. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-像这样小幅转动 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] 'Cause the second that you don't do it quickly you jackknife.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为你一慢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.84,0:26:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-就会折过去 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.12,0:26:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The trailer's got a mind of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.12,0:26:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这拖拉机有自己的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.48,0:27:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What I'm gonna do is I'm gonna counter what he wants to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.48,0:27:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要做的就是 它想干吗 我就反着来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.84,0:27:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] All right? -[Lisa] Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.84,0:27:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-明白吗？ -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] You've got this.
