Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.80,0:34:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] How are you feeling? -Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.80,0:34:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-感觉怎么样？ -挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.36,0:34:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Yeah? -Strong, yeah, no, strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.36,0:34:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-是吗？ -有力气 对 有力气
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.12,0:34:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How'd it all go, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.12,0:34:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}手术怎么样？还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.48,0:34:45.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I won't know whether it's worked or not for...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.48,0:34:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可能要到十一月才知道… 到底管不管用
