Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.24,0:34:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, okay. What, have you just gotta do like general blood tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.24,0:34:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 你还得做常规血检之类的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.76,0:34:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, they do blood tests and things.
