Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Um, you know, the prostate,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是前列腺那边
