Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.20,0:35:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you ever got a magnifying glass on a piece of paper on a sunny day?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.20,0:35:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有没有在晴天用放大镜照过纸？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.48,0:35:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.48,0:35:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-有 让它…对 -对 你能烧出一个小点
