Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.16,0:35:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不会那么干 但我又不是年轻农民
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.68,0:35:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, they do that, but with sound waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.68,0:35:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 他们就用类似的方法 但是用声波
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.56,0:35:13.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they get sound waves and then direct them onto the cancer
