Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.44,0:35:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我唯一的问题是 你知道前列腺在哪儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-you know where the prostate is? -Yeah, yeah.
