Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.24,0:35:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm fine standing up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.24,0:35:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我这样站着没事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.72,0:35:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm fine sitting in like an armchair.
