Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.20,0:36:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以丽莎不用再开运粮车了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.60,0:36:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but she loved it so much she'd nicked one of Kaleb's tractors
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.60,0:36:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但她非常喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.04,0:36:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}直接偷了卡莱布一台拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.40,0:36:10.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and turned up for work as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.40,0:36:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}照常来上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.48,0:36:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy over the radio]  Never done this before. Both of us grain carting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.48,0:36:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们俩以前都没一起运过粮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio]  We are the A Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们是黄金搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.76,0:36:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy coming back, we're now the B Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.76,0:36:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米回来了 我们现在是替补搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.12,0:36:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.72,0:36:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I've missed all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.72,0:36:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真想死这一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.84,0:36:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tractor beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.52,0:36:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is well and truly shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.52,0:36:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真是他妈糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy over the radio]  I mean, I can see with my own eyes that it's shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我亲眼看见这…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.68,0:36:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the combine saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.68,0:36:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}联合收割机上显示多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.04,0:36:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio] 0.2 tonne a hectare.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.04,0:36:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每公顷0.2吨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.24,0:36:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A fifth of a tonne a hectare? -[Kaleb]  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.24,0:36:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-只有五分之一吨？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Six or seven is the average and we're getting 0.2.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正常平均是六到七吨 我们只收了0.2吨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.20,0:36:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.20,0:36:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.08,0:37:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] It's gonna take him about a year and a half to fill the combine up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.08,0:37:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他这得一年半才能把联合收割机装满
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.12,0:37:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.20,0:37:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  After an eternity, Kaleb was finally ready to offload.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.20,0:37:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过了好久
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.60,0:37:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布终于准备卸粮了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.48,0:37:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio]  Lisa, where are you? I'm about to be full in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.48,0:37:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 你在哪儿？我马上满了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.24,0:37:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa over the radio] Amazing. Yeah, on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.24,0:37:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太好了 好 我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa's engine starting and rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Lisa, on the way back down after this run here, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 丽莎 你这趟送完 从后面那条路走 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.32,0:37:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.32,0:37:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.00,0:37:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Kaleb, erm... [clearing his throat]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.00,0:37:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.92,0:37:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I don't mind, I'm just wondering why you selected Lisa
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.92,0:37:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我倒是不介意 我就是好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.96,0:37:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for this job and not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.96,0:37:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你为什么选丽莎干这活儿 不选我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.76,0:37:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  'Cause she's better at it than you to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.76,0:37:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 她干得比你好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.40,0:37:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.40,0:37:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.64,0:37:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Lisa, let's go to channel 6 or something, and Jeremy can stay on 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa and Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.92,0:37:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Well done, Lisa. Perfect again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 丽莎 又很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.68,0:37:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.68,0:37:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.12,0:37:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are kidding. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.12,0:37:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你开玩笑吧 就这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.20,0:38:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio] That was all of it. It's mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.20,0:38:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这么多了 太夸张了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.24,0:38:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy over the radio]  Hey, hold on, are we finished this field?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.24,0:38:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 等等 这块地收完了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.72,0:38:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Yeah, this field's done, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.72,0:38:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这块地完事了 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.68,0:38:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  So I was completely redundant?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.68,0:38:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我完全多余了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.80,0:38:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Thank you for showing up, though, it means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.80,0:38:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但谢谢你出现 这意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.56,0:38:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.56,0:38:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们转到下一块地的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.44,0:38:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  As we moved into the next field...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.40,0:38:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[grunting in pain]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.40,0:38:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb speaking indistinctly over the radio]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.24,0:38:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  A man arrived who I could now share medical war stories with.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.24,0:38:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来了一个人 我终于 可以跟他交流医疗心得了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.72,0:38:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Ah, Gerald. -[Gerald] Jeremy!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.72,0:38:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.40,0:38:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you? You all right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.32,0:38:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I had the, um... The op.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.32,0:38:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没事 我做了手术
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.36,0:38:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they're just fingers crossed it's worked. You don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.36,0:38:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 希望这管用吧 还不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.12,0:38:41.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I tell you what though. Catheter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.12,0:38:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.72,0:38:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.72,0:38:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}导尿管
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.84,0:38:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.92,0:38:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.64,0:38:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Going on four to five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.88,0:38:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I went to put me hand down to pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.32,0:38:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just... It keeps on "bing, bing, bing", didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.68,0:38:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Took all the skin right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.48,0:38:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.76,0:39:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.52,0:39:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[both laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.04,0:39:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly, no, that was the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.04,0:39:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 没错 那是最难受的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.40,0:39:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio] 70% full now, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.40,0:39:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 我现在百分之七十满了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.64,0:39:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.64,0:39:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收到
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.72,0:39:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you got injections to have in your bum,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.76,0:39:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and some there as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.40,0:39:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Huh? -They'll tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.40,0:39:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.88,0:39:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.88,0:39:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我每次去都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.24,0:39:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hot cross buns, I call them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.00,0:39:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.44,0:39:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.44,0:39:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio] Lisa, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.72,0:39:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa over the radio] Yeah, coming to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.72,0:39:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 马上到你旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Funny enough... [speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, bloody hell! She's done it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我靠 她又抢先了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.52,0:39:45.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.36,0:39:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The Kaleb-and-Lisa stitch-up carried on all day
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.36,0:39:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布和丽莎的“非法组队” 整天都在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.92,0:39:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}despite my best efforts to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.92,0:39:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管我尽力想搅和进去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.60,0:39:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna drive alongside Kaleb all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.60,0:39:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要一直开在卡莱布旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.36,0:39:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then he's forced
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.36,0:40:03.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那他就只能把粮卸进我的拖车里了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.40,0:40:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to unload his seed into my trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.36,0:40:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you gonna do about that, Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.36,0:40:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你打算怎么办 丽莎？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.80,0:40:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.76,0:40:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.12,0:40:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.12,0:40:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.84,0:40:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.84,0:40:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.52,0:40:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy wants a load!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.52,0:40:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米想要这一车
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.36,0:40:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa's gonna block him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.36,0:40:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎要挡住他
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.12,0:40:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Lisa, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.12,0:40:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.04,0:40:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.04,0:40:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托 你们俩！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.56,0:40:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The following morning, I was desperate to do some grain carting
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 我拼命想去开运粮车
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.92,0:40:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but first of all, I had to check on the animal hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.92,0:40:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但首先 我得去看看动物医院
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.96,0:40:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Aw, you're back lying down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.96,0:40:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你又躺下了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.16,0:40:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mind you, your head's up, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.16,0:40:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过你头抬起来了 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.88,0:41:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, you can fight off a bit of pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.88,0:41:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 你能扛过肺炎的 我就扛过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.24,0:41:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.48,0:41:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh, up you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.48,0:41:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.28,0:41:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's good, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.28,0:41:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不错
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.32,0:41:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw, Endgame.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.32,0:41:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}终局
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.64,0:41:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look. How are you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.64,0:41:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 今天怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.40,0:41:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Endgame exhaling]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.40,0:41:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好公牛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.32,0:41:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good bull. Good bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.04,0:41:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're lucky being able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.04,0:41:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能这样真幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.16,0:41:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Endgame mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.80,0:41:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't do that. Not without squealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.80,0:41:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在那样做的话 不尖叫是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.52,0:41:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll see you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.52,0:41:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.40,0:41:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.48,0:41:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Visit over, I went to join Kaleb and Lisa
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.48,0:41:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}探病结束 我去找卡莱布和丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as they were harvesting the very last field of 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们正在收2025年的最后一块地
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.68,0:41:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.88,0:41:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa]  I'm arriving at the field now. Where would you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.88,0:41:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在到地里了 你想让我去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.20,0:41:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Yeah, no, I'm gonna want you on the east side.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.20,0:41:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我要你到东边来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.20,0:41:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开在你后面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.24,0:41:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, look, Lisa has queue-jumped again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.24,0:41:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.28,0:41:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎又插队了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.80,0:42:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[phone ringing]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Taya over the phone]  Hello. -[Kaleb] Hello. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-喂？ -喂 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're definitely in labour now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你确定已经开始宫缩了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.12,0:42:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Taya]  Yeah. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.12,0:42:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.52,0:42:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How close are they then?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.52,0:42:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 那间隔多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.04,0:42:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Taya]  Every five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.04,0:42:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每五分钟一次
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.60,0:42:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How-- how close do you need 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.60,0:42:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}间隔多久该去医院？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.36,0:42:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah, all right. Bye, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.36,0:42:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 好的 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.28,0:42:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over the radio]  Taya's in labour.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.28,0:42:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}塔雅开始宫缩了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.08,0:42:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.08,0:42:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.12,0:42:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.12,0:42:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.04,0:42:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit, you gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.04,0:42:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操 你得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.08,0:42:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  No, not yet. I'll finish this field quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.08,0:42:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 还不用 我先迅速把这块地收完
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.48,0:42:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You did hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.48,0:42:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们听见了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.60,0:42:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Jesus, mate, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.60,0:42:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 哥们 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you believe it, he's gonna carry on harvesting even though Taya's in labour.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你敢信吗 塔雅都开始宫缩了
