Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.28,0:42:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那她怎么去医院？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:43:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they're only every five minutes at the moment, the contractions,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:43:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是每五分钟宫缩一次
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:03.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so she's got a bit of time, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以还有点时间 所以…
