Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.40,0:43:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁陪着她？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Er, no one.
