Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.92,0:43:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}between his partner and, like, cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.48,0:43:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, cows can manage."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.48,0:43:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“牛自己能行”
