Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.52,0:43:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我算了一下 大概半小时就能收完 哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.12,0:43:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Yeah, I think so roughly yeah.
