Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.80,0:43:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Yeah, a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.80,0:43:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}知道 是个小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.56,0:43:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.56,0:43:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想好名字了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.08,0:43:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.08,0:43:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想好了
