Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.64,0:43:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}叫什么？杰里米？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.20,0:43:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb]  Definitely fucking not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.20,0:43:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然不是
