Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.64,0:43:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不到三十分钟后
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.60,0:43:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the father-to-be was completing his very last strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.60,0:43:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这位准爸爸收完了最后一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.92,0:43:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.92,0:43:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
