Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.68,0:44:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}2025年丰收完成
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.28,0:44:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And let us never, ever repeat it.
