Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.84,0:44:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very best of luck. Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.84,0:44:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-祝你好运 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.52,0:44:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Thank you very much. -Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.52,0:44:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-非常感谢 -快走吧 你最好回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.12,0:44:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You better get back.
