Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.56,0:44:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the fact that your girlfriend was in labour.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.56,0:44:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}女友宫缩这事给剪掉
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.56,0:44:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I'll send you a picture. -Give her my love. Yeah, do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.56,0:44:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-祝你好运 -我给你发照片
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.24,0:44:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}代我向她问好 一定
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.52,0:44:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.52,0:44:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有名字
