Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.20,0:44:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为还要分析结果
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.72,0:45:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the whole farm was still on lockdown
