Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.24,0:45:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, there was a moment I'd been looking forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.24,0:45:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 有一个我一直在期待的时刻
