Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.92,0:45:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and was now ready to share her findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.92,0:45:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在准备分享她的发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.00,0:45:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.04,0:45:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a bit American.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.04,0:45:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有点美国范儿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.96,0:45:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-This is all a bit American. -It is a bit American, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.96,0:45:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这全套都有点美国范儿 是吧？ -是有点美国范儿 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.68,0:45:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought we were gonna be sitting on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.68,0:45:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来以为我们会坐地上
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.28,0:45:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Cheers. -No, I'm too old for that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.28,0:45:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-干杯 -不 我这把老骨头可受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.52,0:45:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, you've done your bird survey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.52,0:45:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 你的鸟类调查做完了？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.72,0:45:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have. Do you wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.72,0:45:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-做完了 你想知道结果吗？ -想 我真的特别想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.04,0:45:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes! I'm genuinely longing to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.60,0:45:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, right. So these little circles are all the singing species.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.60,0:45:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 这些圆圈代表正在鸣唱的鸟种
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.24,0:45:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you walk along all these hedges and listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.24,0:45:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就沿着这些树篱走…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.84,0:46:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And every time I heard a species that's singing,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.84,0:45:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -…然后听？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.84,0:46:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每次我听到一个鸟种在叫
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.28,0:46:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I make a little note and then carry on walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.28,0:46:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就记一下 然后继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.24,0:46:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Great tit, Chaffinch. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.24,0:46:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-大山雀 苍头燕雀 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.88,0:46:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Blackbird.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.88,0:46:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-乌鸫 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.88,0:46:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] BT? Blue Tit? Robin. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.88,0:46:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蓝山雀？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.16,0:46:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -知更鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.28,0:46:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yellowhammer. -Yellowhammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.28,0:46:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-黄鹀 -黄鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.48,0:46:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wood Pigeon, Skylark.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.48,0:46:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}斑尾林鸽、云雀…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.96,0:46:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, the point is:
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.96,0:46:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 关键是 一个普通的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.36,0:46:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an average farm with average birds would have between 20 and 35 species.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.36,0:46:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}平均大概有20到35种鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.28,0:46:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you have... Dadada!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.28,0:46:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你这个地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.56,0:46:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Forty-five? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.56,0:46:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-45种 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.72,0:46:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] We've got 45 different birds? -[Hannah] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.72,0:46:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（45种！ （普通农场20到35种））
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.20,0:46:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们这里有45种不同的鸟 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.68,0:46:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.68,0:46:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.00,0:46:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But that's not even the best bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.00,0:46:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这还不是最厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.76,0:46:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-God, it gets better. -Turn over the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.76,0:46:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-天哪 还有更厉害的？ -翻过来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.00,0:46:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dadada!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the territory mapping of the whole Corn Bunting population
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（肥麦穗（黍鹀））
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.36,0:46:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on your farm, because I got...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.36,0:46:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是整个黍鹀种群在你农场的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.64,0:46:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you've never heard a Corn Bunting before you got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.64,0:46:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-领地分布图… -你来这儿之前从没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.76,0:46:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. I mean, I've been crying about these birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.76,0:46:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-黍鹀叫吧？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.92,0:46:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直为这些鸟揪心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.12,0:46:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These guys have lost between 83 and 86% of their whole population.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.12,0:46:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个物种的种群数量 已经减少了百分之八十三到八十六
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.24,0:46:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're completely extinct in Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.24,0:46:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在爱尔兰已经彻底灭绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.96,0:46:52.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are pockets of this country that they're just gone from.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.96,0:46:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在这个国家的有些地区 它们也已经消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.44,0:46:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this location is quite a special little place.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.44,0:46:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你这块地方挺特别的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.92,0:46:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And more than 10 Corn Buntings
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.92,0:46:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}超过十只黍鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is kind of trophy-winning area.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就算得上是拿奖的区域了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.56,0:47:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we've got one, two, three... We've got five.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.56,0:47:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有一、二、三…我们有五只
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.72,0:47:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-No, you've got 19. -We've got 19?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.72,0:47:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 你有19只 -我们有19只？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.84,0:47:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] You've got 19. Whoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.84,0:47:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有19只
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 你是说这个农场
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.56,0:47:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What you're saying is this farm is top few percent for birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.56,0:47:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在鸟类这方面属于顶尖的那一小撮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.52,0:47:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, this is what's so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.52,0:47:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这就是为什么这么让人兴奋！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.04,0:47:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[chuckling] -So what are we missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.04,0:47:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 那我们还缺什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.96,0:47:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to see a murmuration of Starlings before I croak.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.96,0:47:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想在我死之前看一次椋鸟群飞
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.08,0:47:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay look, I'll just go hi, Starlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.08,0:47:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好的 我就说：“嗨 椋鸟们” -你懂我意思 我们能做点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.72,0:47:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you know what I mean. Whatever we can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.56,0:47:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How long have we got before you croak?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.56,0:47:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还有多久会“死”？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.12,0:47:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.12,0:47:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.60,0:47:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, let me know, because that's a long-term plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.60,0:47:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得告诉我 因为那是个长期计划
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.84,0:47:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Is it? -On your death bed, finale of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.84,0:47:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-是吗？ -可能是你临终前
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.36,0:47:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.36,0:47:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}节目的最后一集
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.68,0:47:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.60,0:47:40.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, can I show you the end thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.60,0:47:40.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我能给你看最后一件事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.20,0:47:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought I would do one thing where I linked a bird
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.20,0:47:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想做一件事 用一种鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.80,0:47:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to you, Kaleb, Charlie and Lisa, for reasons, I've got reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.80,0:47:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来分别形容你、卡莱布、查理、丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.20,0:47:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.20,0:47:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我有我的理由 -那你来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.00,0:47:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Have you drawn all this? -I know, I'm really lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.00,0:47:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些全是你画的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.40,0:47:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.04,0:47:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll do you last. Charlie looks quite like a Grey Partridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.04,0:47:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我最后说你 查理 很像灰山鹑
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.64,0:47:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's got that kind of English gent thing going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.64,0:47:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-有那种英国绅士的感觉 -确实
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.72,0:47:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] He does. He stands like a colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.72,0:47:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-他站那儿像是个上校 -对！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.56,0:48:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah! -When he's still, he looks like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.56,0:48:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他站着不动的时候 看起来像是个上校
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.64,0:48:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he's got a perfectly symmetrical circular face
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.64,0:48:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且他有一张完美对称的圆脸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.40,0:48:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-like the Partridge. -[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.40,0:48:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-像山鹑 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.56,0:48:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] Kaleb, it's the hairstyle and he's blonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.56,0:48:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 他的发型 而且他是金发
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.64,0:48:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's a bit of a king of the castle of the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.64,0:48:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他在农场有点“老大”的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.36,0:48:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you think Kaleb's a Yellowhammer? Can't we just say a Gingerhammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.36,0:48:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得卡莱布像黄鹀吗？ 我们能不能叫他姜黄鹀？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, absolutely, you can change it. Gingerhammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然可以 我们可以改成姜黄鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.28,0:48:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa... Kestrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.28,0:48:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 红隼
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.72,0:48:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Beautifully elegant, doesn't take any shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.72,0:48:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}优雅漂亮 不好惹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.04,0:48:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] She is like a Kestrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.04,0:48:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她确实像红隼
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.76,0:48:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah] And then this one. -Skylark.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.76,0:48:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后是这位
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.96,0:48:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] National treasure and gobshite.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.96,0:48:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}云雀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.36,0:48:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}国宝级人物 还爱嚷嚷
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.32,0:48:28.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can hear them everywhere across the farm. They're so gobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.32,0:48:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在农场到处都能听到它们叫 它们可真能嚷嚷
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.00,0:48:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I quite like being a Skylark.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.00,0:48:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挺像云雀的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.56,0:48:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not sure about the "national treasure" bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.56,0:48:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -国宝级那部分我不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.64,0:48:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, well. -Anyway, thank you for that, Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯… -总之 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.48,0:48:42.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That has genuinely made my heart sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.48,0:48:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢你 汉娜 这真的让我心里唱起了歌
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.92,0:48:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks for having me on your farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.92,0:48:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢你让我来你的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.16,0:48:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.28,0:48:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right on cue. They've just started singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.28,0:48:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来得正好 它们刚开始叫了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.40,0:48:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-What? Who? What has? -The Skylarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.40,0:48:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.64,0:48:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}云雀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.16,0:48:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.16,0:48:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在呼唤 它们在说 “谢谢你 杰里米”
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.24,0:48:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-They're saying, "Thank you, Jeremy!" -[Hannah and Jeremy chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.24,0:48:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Skylarks chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.92,0:49:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.48,0:49:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Sadly, the elation I felt about the birds of Diddly Squat was short-lived
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.48,0:49:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可惜 迪丽斯库阿特的鸟类 带给我的这种兴奋感没持续多久
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.16,0:49:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because soon, it was time for our pregnant cow
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.16,0:49:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为很快 我们那头怀孕的牛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.24,0:49:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to have her second TB test...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.24,0:49:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就要做第二次结核病检测了…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.84,0:49:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which would be carried out by one of Dilwyn's associates,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.84,0:49:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次来的是迪尔翁的同事 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.84,0:49:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.04,0:49:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hi, Jeremy. -Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.04,0:49:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.36,0:49:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, Dilwyn's still away, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.36,0:49:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}萨姆 迪尔翁还不在？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.04,0:49:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dilwyn's away.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.04,0:49:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪尔翁不在
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.36,0:49:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Sam kicked off by reminding us about our current TB stranglehold.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.36,0:49:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}萨姆一上来就提醒我们 目前结核病封锁的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.32,0:49:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Sam] If she goes today,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.32,0:49:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果今天这头牛也不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.88,0:49:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the rest of the herd will have to be tested again in a month's time
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.88,0:49:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}剩下的牛群一个月后还得再检测一次
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.68,0:49:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then probably again 60 days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.68,0:49:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 大概六天后 很可能还要再测一次 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.48,0:49:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So your farm is under restrictions until that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.48,0:49:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那之前 你的农场会一直受限
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.24,0:49:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I believe the test is a bit haphazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.24,0:49:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得这个检测有点随意
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.04,0:49:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For what reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.04,0:49:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么这么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.04,0:49:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Have you got those tweezers on you? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.04,0:49:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你带了那个卡尺吗？ -带了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.92,0:49:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So you get a lump,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.92,0:49:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 这儿有个肿块 你就这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.84,0:49:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this is what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.48,0:49:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a lump on the cow's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.48,0:49:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-牛脖子上… -对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.04,0:49:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…有个肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.60,0:50:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you walk up to it and you squeeze it, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.60,0:50:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你走过去 捏它一下 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.52,0:50:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then it tells you how big the lump is,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.52,0:50:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后这上面的刻度 就能告诉你肿块有多大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.44,0:50:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause there's a measuring bit here, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.44,0:50:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-明白吗？ -好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.24,0:50:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But if you pull it down hard or not hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.24,0:50:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你捏的时候的力度不同 读出来的数就不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.04,0:50:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you get a different reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.60,0:50:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the cow's doing this while you're trying to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.60,0:50:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且你在测量的时候 牛还在动
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.16,0:50:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you just go, "Well, there's a-"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.16,0:50:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你就说：“有个…”
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.00,0:50:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's only need be a millimetre in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.00,0:50:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实只差一毫米…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.76,0:50:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have to lose a cow, shut the whole farm down,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.76,0:50:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就得损失一头牛 关停整个农场
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.64,0:50:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that is how it's measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.64,0:50:22.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是测量的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.92,0:50:24.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Takes a lot of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.92,0:50:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这得练很久
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.92,0:50:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I still think it's a bit haphazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.92,0:50:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还是觉得有点随意
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.60,0:50:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Nevertheless, this is the test we were going to have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.60,0:50:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不管怎样 这是我们不得不做的检测
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.96,0:50:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] She's a very, very pretty cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.96,0:50:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这头牛真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.16,0:50:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And pregnant with twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.16,0:50:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且怀了双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.72,0:50:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Sam] How far pregnant is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.72,0:50:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怀了多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.84,0:50:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Sam] When is she due? -[Jeremy] Erm, five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.84,0:50:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-预产期什么时候？ -五个月
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.16,0:50:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa] When will we know? -[Jeremy] In about one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.16,0:50:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么时候能知道结果？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.56,0:50:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大概一分钟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.20,0:50:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Ooh, God streuth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.20,0:50:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-天哪 你能把那个递给我吗？ -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.96,0:50:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[gate rattling]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.56,0:50:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Good girl. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.56,0:50:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.72,0:51:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need to look at the chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.72,0:51:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得看看我的图表
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.52,0:51:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[gate rattling]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.48,0:51:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've remeasured both lumps today, on both, er, top and bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.48,0:51:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我今天重新测量了两个肿块 或者说上面和下面的肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.28,0:51:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Is this last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.28,0:51:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是上次的数据？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.56,0:51:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Sam] Yeah, the last time here is 7 mm, and 9 mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.56,0:51:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这是上次的数据 七和九
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.52,0:51:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This time, it's 11 mm and 14 mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.52,0:51:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}七毫米 九毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.60,0:51:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I look at my chart...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.60,0:51:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次是11毫米和14毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.28,0:51:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我查一下图表…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.96,0:51:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She is...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.96,0:51:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.76,0:51:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's IR again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.76,0:51:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它还是“IR”
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.16,0:51:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.16,0:51:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.04,0:51:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie sighing] -What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.04,0:51:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那是什么意思？ -又是不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.48,0:51:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Inconclusive again. -[Sam] Sorry, inconclusive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.48,0:51:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉 还是不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.44,0:51:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-She stays in the barn? -[Charlie] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.44,0:51:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它继续待在谷仓里？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.96,0:51:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. That-- that...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.96,0:51:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 那…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.56,0:51:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That means, er, that she's gonna have to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.56,0:51:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那意味着它得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.92,0:51:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause she's effectively inconclusive twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.92,0:51:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它两次都是不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.36,0:51:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Sam] Yeah. -[Charlie] Is that absolute?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.36,0:51:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -这绝对是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.76,0:51:50.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Sam] Yeah, she's inconclusive twice so she's treated...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.76,0:51:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 它两次都是不确定 所以算作…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.80,0:51:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So she has to be slaughtered even though she's inconclusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.80,0:51:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以就算它是不确定 也得被宰杀？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.72,0:51:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Sam] Yeah, she's treated as a reactor today.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.72,0:51:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 今天就算作阳性反应牛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.48,0:51:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Sam] The problem you've got... -[Jeremy] That is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.48,0:51:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你遇到的问题… -这就像…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.56,0:52:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't understand any of these rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.56,0:52:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我完全不理解这些规定
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.92,0:52:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That seems to me like a hung jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.92,0:52:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我看来 这就像陪审团意见不一致
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.76,0:52:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, it's six and six
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.76,0:52:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}六比六 然后法官说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.04,0:52:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then the judge goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.24,0:52:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"That's inconclusive, so we're gonna execute you."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.24,0:52:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“这个案子没有定论 所以我们判你死刑”
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.00,0:52:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.00,0:52:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That's exactly what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这正是现在发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.24,0:52:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Erm, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.24,0:52:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我能问你一个问题吗？ -可以
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.56,0:52:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can we keep her in here until she has her calves
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.56,0:52:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能把它留在这儿 直到她生下小牛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.72,0:52:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and will the calves have TB?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.72,0:52:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-小牛会有结核病吗？ -这是个好问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.44,0:52:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.44,0:52:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我问她怀了多久了 部分原因就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.92,0:52:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, part of the reason I asked how pregnant she was...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.44,0:52:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If she was in the last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.44,0:52:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它是在最后一个月 我想他们会允许
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.12,0:52:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think they give the option of keeping her in calving down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.12,0:52:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它留在这儿生小牛
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.16,0:52:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but because she's only five months pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.16,0:52:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但她才怀了五个月
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.20,0:52:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they will take her, er, for slaughter, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.20,0:52:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会把它带走 送去宰杀 对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.88,0:52:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, f...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.88,0:52:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.00,0:52:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-You'd hope... -What a year. What a year! Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.00,0:52:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你希望… -你这是…说真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.36,0:52:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.36,0:52:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.12,0:52:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why do people farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.12,0:52:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人们为什么要务农？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.48,0:52:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[scoffing]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.16,0:52:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.16,0:52:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.96,0:52:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right. Thanks, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.96,0:52:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 谢谢 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.88,0:52:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.88,0:53:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The next morning I braced myself for another moment I'd been dreading,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.88,0:53:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 我鼓起勇气 去面对另一个我一直害怕的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.92,0:53:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because Charlie now had the numbers in for our drought-stricken harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.92,0:53:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为查理现在拿到了 我们受干旱影响的收成的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.20,0:53:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] So,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.20,0:53:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以…和我们预期的差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.68,0:53:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that is what we were expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.44,0:53:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] £37,000. -So that was the forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.44,0:53:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三万七千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.32,0:53:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是预测值
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.40,0:53:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, erm, this doesn't factor in the cost of leasing the AgBot or the RoboDroid
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.40,0:53:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这没算上租赁农业机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.80,0:53:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or installing this system, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.80,0:53:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和播种机器人的成本 也没算安装这套系统的成本 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.64,0:53:25.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Er, yes. -Oh, it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.64,0:53:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 没错 -算进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.48,0:53:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] That was how much we thought we'd make from farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.48,0:53:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我们以为种地能赚到的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.56,0:53:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] £37,800, you thought would be our...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.56,0:53:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三万七千八百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.56,0:53:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.56,0:53:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你本来以为会是我们的…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.72,0:53:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Which would have been quite a good year.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.72,0:53:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -本来应该是不错的一年
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.00,0:53:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] If you turn it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.00,0:53:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你翻过这一页的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.52,0:53:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.52,0:53:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 所以今年种地的成本
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.60,0:53:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] So the cost of farming this year has been £5,152.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.60,0:53:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是5152英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.48,0:53:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That's one way of saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.48,0:53:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是其中一种说法
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.32,0:53:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Jeremy, you've lost 5,152."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.32,0:53:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“杰里米 你亏了5152英镑”
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.92,0:53:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.92,0:53:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.20,0:53:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And this is weather-related. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.20,0:53:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这和天气有关 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.56,0:53:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we got 30% less wheat than you were expecting because of the drought.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.56,0:53:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为干旱 我们的小麦比你预期的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.76,0:53:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-少了三成 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.04,0:53:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We got nearly 40% less barley,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.04,0:53:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大麦比预期少了将近百分之四十
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.24,0:54:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}45% less durum than we budgeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.24,0:54:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}硬质小麦少了百分之四十五
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.08,0:54:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So yields were down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.08,0:54:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 产量都下降了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.32,0:54:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, this is bloody dispiriting, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.32,0:54:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真够让人泄气的 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.16,0:54:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Er... Yeah. -It is dispiriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.16,0:54:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-确实让人泄气 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.08,0:54:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it was pretty depressing in year 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.08,0:54:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一年只赚144英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.96,0:54:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when we made a profit of £144,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.96,0:54:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就已经够郁闷的了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.32,0:54:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but here we are in year 6 and we're losing £5,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.32,0:54:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可我们现在都第六年了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.76,0:54:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.76,0:54:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-还亏五千英镑 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.48,0:54:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we did it so bloody well this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.48,0:54:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我们今年 干得那么好 我们面对…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.96,0:54:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I mean, that's the really galling thing. You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.96,0:54:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这才最让人恼火 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.64,0:54:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I know. All of this, all of the technology that we employed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.64,0:54:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我们用了所有这些技术…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.76,0:54:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Exactly. The crops went in really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.76,0:54:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 庄稼种得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.68,0:54:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] With the precision drilling, the precision muck spreading,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.68,0:54:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…精准播种 精准撒肥
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.52,0:54:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}knowing where our good soil is, where our bad soil is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.52,0:54:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}知道哪里土壤肥沃 哪里贫瘠
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.32,0:54:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nutrition just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.32,0:54:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}营养 恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.12,0:54:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, everything was bob on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.12,0:54:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我是说 每件事… -对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.16,0:54:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -So even when you do everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.16,0:54:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-…都完美 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.64,0:54:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.64,0:54:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以 就算你什么… -对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.48,0:54:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you employ all the best, latest technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.48,0:54:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-…都做对了… -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.60,0:54:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…用上了所有最好、最新的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.20,0:54:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-you lose £5,000. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.20,0:54:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你还是亏了五千英镑 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.24,0:54:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, just simply because it doesn't rain for 15 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.24,0:54:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就因为15个星期没下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.28,0:54:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.28,0:55:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在得从我自己的钱里 拿出七万英镑给你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.52,0:55:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm now going to have to give you 70,000 of my own pounds
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.96,0:55:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to pay for the seed and the fertiliser for next year...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.96,0:55:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用来买明年的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.36,0:55:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.36,0:55:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-种子和肥料 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.92,0:55:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the weather might come and ruin it all anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.92,0:55:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且天气可能还是会来捣乱 把一切都毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.92,0:55:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm betting £70,000 that the weather's nice next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.92,0:55:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-其实… -我赌七万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.92,0:55:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明年天气会好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.36,0:55:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I actually need 75, 'cause we lost 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.36,0:55:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我其实需要七万五 因为我们亏了五千
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, Charlie, thank you for dropping round
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:22.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 查理 谢谢你一如既往地 带着你的“好消息”过来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.24,0:55:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with your usual cheerful news.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.32,0:55:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.16,0:55:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I actually thought we'd break even. I didn't think we'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.16,0:55:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来以为我们能收支平衡 没想到会亏
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.44,0:55:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.44,0:55:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.20,0:55:35.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look on the bright side:
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.20,0:55:35.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 往好的方面看
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.28,0:55:37.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we don't have to give Rachel Reeves any of our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.28,0:55:37.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不用给瑞秋里夫斯交任何钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.08,0:55:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clicking his tongue]
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.52,0:55:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.64,0:55:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Normally, a poor harvest result draws a line
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.64,0:55:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}通常 收成不好 这一年的坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.60,0:55:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}under the bad news for the year...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.60,0:55:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就算画上句号了…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.80,0:55:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but not this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.80,0:55:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这次不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.08,0:55:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because we still had to watch our pregnant TB cow
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.08,0:55:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们还必须眼睁睁看着 我们那头怀孕的结核病牛被拉去宰杀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.04,0:55:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}go off to slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's when she was just born! -Yeah, that was when she was just born.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那是它刚出生的时候 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.16,0:56:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是它刚出生的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.04,0:56:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That was our first-- she is our first ever cow and I remember taking a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.04,0:56:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我们第一头… 它是我们农场的第一头牛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.40,0:56:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我记得还拍了照
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.20,0:56:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-God, she's bonny, isn't she? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.20,0:56:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-天哪 它真漂亮 是吧？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.68,0:56:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's just gloriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.68,0:56:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它真是美极了… -迪丽斯库阿特的第一头小牛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.88,0:56:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Diddly Squat's first ever calf.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.72,0:56:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And I think we called her Poppy. -[Kaleb] We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.72,0:56:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们给它取名叫波比 -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.48,0:56:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[lorry stopping]
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb snapping his fingers]
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.92,0:56:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Good girl. Steady. Now steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.92,0:56:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 慢点 现在 慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.52,0:56:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[banging]
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.52,0:56:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine starting]
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.68,0:56:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I can't get my head round it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.68,0:56:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的无法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.88,0:56:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think the system is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.88,0:56:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得这个制度有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.76,0:56:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With Covid, they developed a vaccine in, what,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.76,0:56:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}新冠疫情的时候 他们从发现病毒到研发出疫苗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}12 months after it was first identified?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-用了十二个月吧？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.32,0:56:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bovine TB's been around for centuries and they haven't invented anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.32,0:56:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}牛结核病已经存在了几个世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.88,0:56:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.88,0:56:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们到现在 什么都没发明出来 我真不信
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.12,0:57:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, if you're a beef or a dairy farmer, you're 65 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.12,0:57:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你是个养牛户 你现在65岁
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.48,0:57:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you've grown up with bovine TB,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.48,0:57:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从小就跟牛结核病打交道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.32,0:57:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you get it and then it goes and it comes and it goes
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.32,0:57:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得病 然后好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.52,0:57:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you kind of get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.52,0:57:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后又得 又好了 慢慢就习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.92,0:57:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I'm new to this. I'm new to it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.92,0:57:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我是头一回碰上
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.56,0:57:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's a shit feeling. -No, it's not that it's a shit feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.56,0:57:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我是头一回碰上 你们知道吗？ -这感觉真操蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.04,0:57:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我…不 不只是感觉操蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm actually pissed off, 'cause I don't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 -我其实是生气
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.60,0:57:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我不接受这事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't accept that the testing is sensible
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我认为这种检测方式并不合理
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.28,0:57:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I don't believe that this slaughtering is the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.28,0:57:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我也不相信宰杀是解决问题的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.96,0:57:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I don't believe that science cannot work out
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.96,0:57:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我不相信科学没办法 研究出怎么给牛接种疫苗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.84,0:57:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}how to vaccinate cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.24,0:57:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I don't believe any of that. -Surely as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.24,0:57:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这些我都不信 -肯定有别的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.32,0:57:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-'Cause I'm new... -Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.32,0:57:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-因为我是新人 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.08,0:57:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, everybody, you, even you at your age, and you,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.08,0:57:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我…每个人 包括你 甚至你这个年纪的你 还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.48,0:57:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and every beef and dairy farmer I've talked to goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.48,0:57:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有我聊过的每个养牛户 都说
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.04,0:57:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Well, you know, it's just one of those facts of farming life."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.04,0:57:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“这就是务农生活的一部分”
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.76,0:57:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm standing here as a new boy going, "how can it be?"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.76,0:57:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我作为一个新人站在这儿 心想
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.68,0:57:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.68,0:57:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“怎么会这样？”
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.36,0:57:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[soft music] -[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.24,0:57:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The woes of the isolation pen still weren't over,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.24,0:57:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}隔离区的烦心事还没完
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.12,0:57:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because despite all the medication,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.12,0:57:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为尽管用了药
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.56,0:58:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our sickly calf wasn't getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.56,0:58:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们那头病怏怏的小牛还是不见好转
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.84,0:58:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this meant we had to call out yet another vet,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.84,0:58:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我们 还得再叫一个兽医来 夏洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.28,0:58:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.44,0:58:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] She's not doing very well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.44,0:58:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它今天状态不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.44,0:58:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can already see, her ears are down and her breathing's up
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.44,0:58:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经看到它耳朵耷拉着 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.80,0:58:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and she's been coughing and...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.80,0:58:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它呼吸急促 一直在咳嗽…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.28,0:58:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Do you think she was born with something then?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.28,0:58:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你觉得它是不是天生就有问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.56,0:58:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because we've tried everything and we've done everything that we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.56,0:58:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为能试的我们都试了 能做的我们都做了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.20,0:58:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] It sounds like it's been a bit of a failure-of-passage transfer,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.20,0:58:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听起来像是被动免疫失败
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.40,0:58:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which basically means that...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.40,0:58:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.96,0:58:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So humans get all their protein,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.96,0:58:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人类是从子宫里获得所有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.64,0:58:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the antibodies which develops the immune system, from the uterus,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.64,0:58:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蛋白质和抗体
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.96,0:58:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}whereas in cows they get it only from the colostrum which is the first milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.96,0:58:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-来发育免疫系统的… -对
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.16,0:58:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…而牛只能从初乳里获得
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.32,0:58:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是头几天的奶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.76,0:58:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I think she's had a bit of a tough start.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.76,0:58:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我觉得她开局就不太顺
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.00,0:58:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the other calves took all her colostrum?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.00,0:58:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 其他小牛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.40,0:58:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -[Jeremy] By the time she learned
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.40,0:58:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-把它的初乳都抢走了？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.96,0:58:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or was strong enough to get up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.96,0:58:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等它学会 或者 等它有力气站起来的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.48,0:58:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-there wasn't any. -[Charlotte] She completely missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.48,0:58:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 它完全错过了 -一点都没剩下…操
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.68,0:58:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Shit. -[Charlotte] So that means
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.68,0:58:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那意味着 它以后接触到的任何病菌
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.32,0:58:48.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that any bug that she's exposed to,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.52,0:58:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}she won't develop any form of immunity to.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.52,0:58:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都无法建立免疫
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.56,0:58:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Despite throwing everything at her with antibiotics and pain killers,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.56,0:58:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 尽管你给它 用了各种抗生素和止痛药
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.96,0:58:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}she won't fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.96,0:58:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它还是扛不过去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.28,0:58:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what do we do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.28,0:58:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我们接下来怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.36,0:58:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly, I think we need to be kind
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.36,0:58:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 我觉得我们 应该人道一点 帮它解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.84,0:59:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and put her out of her misery and elect to euthanase.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.84,0:59:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}选择安乐死
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.24,0:59:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.24,0:59:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.16,0:59:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How does one go about, as you say, euthanasing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.16,0:59:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说的安乐死 具体是怎么操作的？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.88,0:59:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] So effectively, it's an overdose of a sedative,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.88,0:59:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实就是过量注射镇静剂
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.48,0:59:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so it slows her breathing and slows her heart rate and eventually it stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.48,0:59:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它的呼吸变慢 心跳变慢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.92,0:59:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后停止
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.24,0:59:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But how's she going to react, the mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.24,0:59:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但牛妈妈会有什么反应？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.52,0:59:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.52,0:59:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看情况
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.56,0:59:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Some think it's good for them to see them go so they know it's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.56,0:59:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有些人觉得让它们看着比较好 这样它们就知道彻底结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.60,0:59:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Come on, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.60,0:59:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] Hello, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 我的宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.00,0:59:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.00,0:59:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.96,0:59:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good girl. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.96,0:59:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好姑娘 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.00,0:59:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's okay. It's all right. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.00,0:59:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-慢点 好的 好了 -好了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.68,0:59:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy whispering] Poor little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.68,0:59:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可怜的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.56,0:59:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] Come on, my love. I know. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.56,0:59:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 我的宝贝 我知道 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.20,0:59:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Good girl. -[Jeremy] How do I hold her head?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.20,0:59:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好姑娘 -我来把它的头按低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.88,0:59:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] That's perfect. I'm gonna pop her ear out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.88,0:59:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-很好 -就那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.08,0:59:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把它的耳朵拨开
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.12,0:59:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.12,0:59:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.32,0:59:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.32,0:59:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.64,0:59:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlotte] Aw... -[Jeremy] Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.64,0:59:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.32,0:59:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] All right. Such a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.32,0:59:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 宝贝 好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.08,1:00:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna flip her to the other side so we can go in that other vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.08,0:59:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我给它翻到另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.92,1:00:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}打另一条静脉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.04,1:00:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy grunting]
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.36,1:00:08.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.36,1:00:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.00,1:00:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.00,1:00:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它走了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.28,1:00:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-She's gone? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.28,1:00:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它走了？ -对
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.48,1:00:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] Well done, mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.48,1:00:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 牛妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.84,1:00:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlotte] Well done, guys. That's never easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.84,1:00:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 各位 这种事向来不容易
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.76,1:00:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Thanks, Charlotte. -You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.76,1:00:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-非常感谢 -不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.36,1:00:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa] Thanks. -[Charlotte] Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.36,1:00:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-谢谢 -保重
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.00,1:00:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy sighing]
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.56,1:00:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft folk music]
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.44,1:00:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Despite it feeling like there was nothing to celebrate,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.44,1:00:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然感觉没什么值得庆祝的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.60,1:00:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the Diddly Squat gang met up in a field called the Big Quiet
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.60,1:00:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但迪丽斯库阿特的一行人还是 聚在了一块叫“大静地”的地里…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.32,1:00:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for our traditional end-of-year picnic
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.32,1:00:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}举行我们传统的年终野餐
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.36,1:00:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft folk music continues]
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.88,1:01:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This time lunching on all-British pizzas we were now making at the pub.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.88,1:01:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次吃的是 我们在酒吧新做的全英式披萨
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.48,1:01:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Here we go, have some pizza, Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.48,1:01:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来 吃点披萨 杰拉德
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.36,1:01:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Who'd like some more meatball?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.36,1:01:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁还要肉丸？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.64,1:01:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And after we'd finished eating,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.64,1:01:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吃完之后
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.76,1:01:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we got to talking about our 'annus horribilis'.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.76,1:01:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们开始聊起这倒霉的一年
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.76,1:01:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we started the year and I had coronary heart disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.76,1:01:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 这一年开头 我得了冠心病
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.40,1:01:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ended it with me with cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.40,1:01:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结尾 我得了癌症
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.16,1:01:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, in between, we had Rachel Reeves.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.16,1:01:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}中间遇到了瑞秋里夫斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.72,1:01:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then we had a drought,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.72,1:01:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后干旱
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.24,1:01:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}dismal yields.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.24,1:01:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收成惨淡
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.92,1:01:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now, we've got TB.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.92,1:01:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在又来了结核病
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.32,1:01:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I don't know the result on the TB then.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.32,1:01:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还不知道结核病的最终结果
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.56,1:01:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what is the result?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.56,1:01:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 结果是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.68,1:01:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The one with twin calves?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.68,1:01:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怀双胞胎的那头？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.32,1:01:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] The one with twins. -Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.32,1:01:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-怀双胞胎的那头 -不
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.44,1:01:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You... Honestly, everything, Gerald, the whole year.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.44,1:01:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 杰拉德 这一年从头到尾都是事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.96,1:01:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know it's the first year we've made an actual loss on the farm?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.96,1:01:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 这是我们农场 第一次真正意义上的亏损
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.88,1:01:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Is it? -[Charlie and Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.88,1:01:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-是吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.44,1:01:55.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, we can dwell as much as we like
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.44,1:01:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 我们可以一直沉浸在
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.20,1:02:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on all the bad things that have happened on the farm,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.20,1:02:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农场发生的所有坏事中
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.20,1:02:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it's probably better now, at the end of another year,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.20,1:02:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我觉得在又一年的末尾
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.96,1:02:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to focus on things that have happened that have been good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.96,1:02:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们更应该想想那些好的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.56,1:02:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Erm...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.04,1:02:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Puppies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.04,1:02:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-小狗？ -小狗是好事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.00,1:02:17.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Puppies were good. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.00,1:02:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -它确实生了不少小狗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.48,1:02:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] She did have a lot of puppies. -She did well.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.48,1:02:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 它挺厉害 -它做得太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.60,1:02:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] She did brilliantly. -[Lisa] Kaleb had a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.60,1:02:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布有了个孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.72,1:02:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Another baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.72,1:02:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又一个孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.04,1:02:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that good?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.04,1:02:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那是好事吗？ -孩子？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.04,1:02:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy laughing] Maybe!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.08,1:02:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna throw in the EasyCare sheep.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.08,1:02:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要提名易养羊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.20,1:02:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] That was a good... Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.20,1:02:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是个好…对 不
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.12,1:02:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You have even bought some.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.12,1:02:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你甚至自己也买了 你以前可是说过
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.28,1:02:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-You, having said... -[Kaleb] I got 30.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.28,1:02:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我没有羊 我也不想要羊”
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.04,1:02:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"Oh, fucking sheep, I hate sheep." -[Kaleb] No, I do hate sheep,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.04,1:02:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我确实讨厌羊 我觉得它们糟透了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.44,1:02:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think they're fucking awful, but EasyCare sheep are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.44,1:02:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-但易养羊很棒 -对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -[Charlie] EasyCare's lambs are...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}易养羊的羊羔…它们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.20,1:02:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-They're cracking. -[Jeremy] Yeah, really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.20,1:02:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-特别好 -对 特别好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.32,1:02:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.32,1:02:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 那确实不错
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.20,1:02:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The underground mapping: really, really useful, we think.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.20,1:02:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}地下测绘 我们觉得非常非常有用
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if we get a year with some rain and some sunshine
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等哪一年雨水和阳光都合适
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.96,1:02:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as opposed to one or the other,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.96,1:02:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而不是只有一样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.72,1:02:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'll be able to make some meaningful conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.72,1:02:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就能得出有意义的结论了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.32,1:02:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.32,1:02:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 那是好事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.76,1:02:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The AgBot was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.76,1:02:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-农业机器人也不错 -是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.68,1:02:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Was it? -Yeah. I know you didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.68,1:02:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 我知道你不喜欢它 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.52,1:03:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] I'm a fan. -[Lisa laughing] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.52,1:03:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是它的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.12,1:03:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So here we are, we're finding lots of good things.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.12,1:03:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 你看 我们找到了不少好事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.48,1:03:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.48,1:03:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有别的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.60,1:03:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] When will we know?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.60,1:03:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你的治疗效果什么时候能知道？ -什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.20,1:03:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] What? -If the treatment's worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.04,1:03:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know, I've got a blood test today.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.04,1:03:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 我得做个血检 会有一个血检 然后我们就知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.48,1:03:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There'll be a blood test and then we'll know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.96,1:03:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not for another few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.96,1:03:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还要等几周
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.32,1:03:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, cheer up. Probably did work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.32,1:03:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行了 高兴点 说不定就治好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.64,1:03:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa laughing] Don't stare at me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.64,1:03:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.60,1:03:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was in a bad way when you went away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.60,1:03:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你走的那段时间我可惨了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.12,1:03:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I just thought, "where am I gonna send my invoice to?"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.12,1:03:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就在想 “我的发票该寄给谁啊？”
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.24,1:03:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Exactly. -[all laughing]
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.24,1:03:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.36,1:03:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[phone ringing]
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.88,1:03:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.96,1:03:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[phone ringing]
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.48,1:03:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald] Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.48,1:03:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.56,1:03:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[phone continues ringing]
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.56,1:03:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 根本…根本关不掉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.60,1:03:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it wouldn't even go off. It wouldn't even go off!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.60,1:03:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}根本关不掉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.84,1:03:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How to switch it on silent, Gerald?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.84,1:03:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么调成静音 杰拉德？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.88,1:03:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa laughing] -It won't even switch off.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.88,1:03:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我正想说 它根本关不掉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.80,1:03:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[phone ringing] -Should we call it a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.80,1:03:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们是不是该收工了？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.44,1:03:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[phone continues ringing] -[Jeremy] Technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.44,1:03:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}科技
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.52,1:03:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[phone continues ringing] -Fuckin' hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.52,1:03:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.88,1:04:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[all laughing]
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.28,1:04:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.32,1:04:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  I have to be honest, we did wrap the programme at this point,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.32,1:04:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 我们当时确实收工了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.44,1:04:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but the following morning, we called all the film crews back
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.44,1:04:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但第二天早上 我们把所有摄制组都叫了回来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.28,1:04:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because Charlie said he had some news.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.28,1:04:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为查理说他有个消息
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.88,1:04:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've had a letter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.88,1:04:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我收到了一封信
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.96,1:04:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So post-mortem on the cow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.96,1:04:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那头牛的尸检报告
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.72,1:04:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.72,1:04:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.72,1:04:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What am I looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.72,1:04:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我该看哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.52,1:04:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a little box.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.52,1:04:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有个小方框
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.40,1:04:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are three words. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.40,1:04:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}里面就四个字
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.88,1:04:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] "Non-visible lesions."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.88,1:04:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“未见病变”
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.52,1:04:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. So...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.52,1:04:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.84,1:04:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it didn't have TB.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.84,1:04:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 它没有得结核病
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.08,1:04:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then spoke to the vet, er, who works for the APHA,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.08,1:04:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我联系了为动植物卫生局
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.80,1:04:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Defra basically.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.80,1:04:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}工作的兽医… 其实就是环境粮食与农村事务部
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.16,1:04:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she said, "Yeah, we've taken samples,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.16,1:04:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她说：“对 我们取了样本
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.92,1:04:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but nothing has conclusively said that she's got TB."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.92,1:04:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但没有任何证据证明它得了结核病”
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.72,1:05:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they've killed my pregnant cow for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.72,1:05:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 他们毫无理由地 杀了我那头怀孕的牛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.40,1:05:04.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I'd heard about this from farmers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.40,1:05:04.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以前听农民说过这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.20,1:05:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They all... Well, not all, but a lot of them have said
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.20,1:05:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们…不全是 但很多人都说
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.20,1:05:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"There are cows that are being killed, they haven't got TB,"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.20,1:05:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们被杀掉的牛其实没有结核病
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that's happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-现在轮到我们了 -我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.56,1:05:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know that expression "your blood's boiling"? Mine is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.56,1:05:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你听过“气得血往上涌” 这个说法吗？我现在就是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.36,1:05:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy clearing his throat]
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.96,1:05:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just, you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.96,1:05:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是 你知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.04,1:05:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It does feel wasteful today, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.04,1:05:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天确实感觉很浪费 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.96,1:05:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-But... -Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.96,1:05:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-但是… -那是不是意味着…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.56,1:05:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that means there's no TB on the farm, so we're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.56,1:05:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那意味着农场里没有结核病
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.56,1:05:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们自由了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.56,1:05:35.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. We're still closed, er...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.56,1:05:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我们还是关着的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.80,1:05:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're still in the process, we're still in the procedure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.80,1:05:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还在走流程
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.32,1:05:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-还在走程序 -所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.12,1:05:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've killed my cow, my pregnant cow,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.12,1:05:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们杀了我的牛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.80,1:05:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -我怀孕的牛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.12,1:05:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they've looked in the pregnant cow, seen that it's got no TB,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.12,1:05:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们检查了那头怀孕的牛 发现没有结核病
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.28,1:05:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so instead of writing to us saying, "Okay, you're free to carry on,"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.28,1:05:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果没写信说 “好了 你们可以继续了”
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.68,1:05:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're now saying we can't, we're still...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.68,1:05:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}反而说我们不能…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.32,1:05:51.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-We have to do... -Locked down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.32,1:05:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们还得做… -封锁？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.92,1:05:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, within 60 days, we've got another test.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.92,1:05:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 60天内 我们再做一次检测
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.08,1:05:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And it... -Who is running Defra?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.08,1:05:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-如果… -谁在管环境粮食与农村事务部？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.12,1:05:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is the matter with them?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.12,1:05:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们到底有什么毛病？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.52,1:06:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.52,1:06:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.88,1:06:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.52,1:06:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Things can't get worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.52,1:06:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}情况不会更糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.72,1:06:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（4天后）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[siren blaring]
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（急救转运车）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.60,1:06:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we started season 5 with me in a hospital bed,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.60,1:06:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 第五季开头 我躺在病床上
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.44,1:06:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and here we are at the end of season 5 and I'm back in a hospital bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.44,1:06:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在第五季结尾 我又躺回病床上了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.44,1:06:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Some of the treatment's gone a bit... awry, let's say.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.44,1:06:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这么说吧 治疗出了一点小岔子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.84,1:06:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm gonna be here for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.84,1:06:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我得在这儿待一阵子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.96,1:06:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.12,1:06:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Are you nil by mouth? Oh you are, I can see the sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.12,1:06:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不能吃东西 也不能喝水？ 我看到牌子了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.00,1:06:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm nil by mouth, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.00,1:06:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 不能吃东西也不能喝水 我不知道接下来会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.40,1:06:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.88,1:06:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But look, what I wanted to say was, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.88,1:06:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我想说的是…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.16,1:06:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if this is all successful, I'll see you in for season 6.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.16,1:06:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果一切顺利 我们第六季见
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.00,1:06:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if it isn't, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.00,1:06:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果不顺利 那就不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.40,1:07:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy laughing]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.08,1:07:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Take care everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.08,1:07:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家保重
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.24,1:07:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}["Always Look On the Brightside of Life" by Monty Python starts playing]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.24,1:07:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.96,1:07:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Always look on the bright side of life ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.96,1:07:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总是要看到生活光明的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.96,1:07:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（您正在收看的是…）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.76,1:07:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Always look on the light side of life ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.76,1:07:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总是要看到生活光明的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.96,1:07:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（安妮）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.72,1:07:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ If life seems jolly rotten, there's something you've forgotten ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.72,1:07:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（迪尔翁）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.64,1:07:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果生活看起来糟透了 那是你忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.32,1:07:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And that's to laugh and smile and dance and sing ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.32,1:07:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去开怀大笑 去微笑、去跳舞、去歌唱
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.96,1:07:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ When you're feeling in the dumps, don't be silly, chumps ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.96,1:07:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（汉娜）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.20,1:07:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当你情绪低落时 别犯傻 傻瓜们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.76,1:07:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Just purse your lips and whistle, that's the thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.76,1:07:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只要噘起嘴 吹个口哨 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.84,1:07:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（查理）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.08,1:07:45.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And always look on the bright side of life ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.08,1:07:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.04,1:07:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总是要看到生活光明的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.56,1:07:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Come on! ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.56,1:07:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.56,1:07:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Always look on the bright side of life ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.56,1:07:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（杰拉德）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.92,1:07:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总是要看到生活光明的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.32,1:08:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ For life is quite absurd, and death's the final word ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.32,1:07:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（丽莎）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.24,1:08:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为人生荒诞 死亡才是终点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.60,1:08:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ You must always face the curtain with a bow ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.60,1:08:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须总是笑着谢幕
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.56,1:08:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Forget about your sin, give the audience a grin ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.56,1:08:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}忘了你的罪过 给观众一个微笑
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.76,1:08:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Enjoy it, it's your last chance anyhow ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.76,1:08:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（卡莱布）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.92,1:08:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好好享受 反正这是你最后的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.52,1:08:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ So always look on the bright side of death ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.52,1:08:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（抱歉 暂停使用 请使用酒吧洗手间）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.64,1:08:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以总是要看到死亡光明的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.76,1:08:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Just before you draw your terminal breath ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.76,1:08:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在你咽下最后一口气之前
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.76,1:08:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Life's a piece of shit when you look at it ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.76,1:08:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生活就是一坨屎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.12,1:08:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（以及杰里米）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.36,1:08:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当你看它的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.80,1:08:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Life's a laugh and death's a joke, it's true ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.80,1:08:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生活是个笑话 而死亡是笑点 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.84,1:08:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ You'll see it's all a show, keep 'em laughing as you go ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.84,1:08:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（尽在）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.92,1:08:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会发现一切都是场表演 一路让他们笑下去
